interface.longDescription:
Uptale is the platform to build immersive training in a matter of hours and deploy it to frontline teams. With the Uptale app, ChatGPT works in your Uptale workspaces as you would in the Uptale editor.

Ask ChatGPT to:
- find and review your workspaces and experiences, scene by scene;
- create an experience and its scenes, then add tags: information panels, quizzes, navigation and media;
- add tag rules, objectives, skills and stars to score learners;
- upload 360 videos, images and sounds, and generate narration with text to speech;
- translate an experience into one of its languages.

ChatGPT only sees and changes what your Uptale account can: you sign in with your Uptale account and choose the workspace access you grant. You need an Uptale account with editor rights in at least one workspace.
